<urn:atm:triage:finding/S22-ATM-QA-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S22-ATM-QA-002" ;
  triage:title "ReconcileRuntimeStatus.shutdown_started_at undocumented extra field" ;
  triage:description "reconcile_runtime.rs on feature/pYe-s22-reconcile-runtime-cutover has ReconcileRuntimeStatus with a fourth field shutdown_started_at: Option<Instant> (line 36) that does not appear in the sprint Y.22 Proposed Design table. The sprint doc lists only three fields: started, shutdown_requested, degraded_message. The field must either be added to the Proposed Design table in sprint-Y22.md or removed from the implementation." ;
